# Libraries and the Humanities: NEH on the Move.

**Authors:** Rochell, Carlton C.

## Abstract
Describes several library programs funded by the National Endowment for the Humanities and encourages librarians to apply for the grants in the future as the number, quality, and variety of applications is not what was expected. (JVP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ203506

